# Demo Page Maintenance

The interactive demo at `/demo` renders the real `Dashboard` component with static data and no API calls. It must stay in sync with the production dashboard.

## When to Update

Update the demo when any change:

- Adds, removes, or renames props on `DashboardShell` or `PortfolioProvider`
- Adds new data requirements to the Dashboard (new context fields, new API data the dashboard expects)
- Changes the `Holding`, `CashEntry`, `QuoteData`, or `ExchangeRates` types in `src/lib/types.ts`
- Adds a new provider wrapper in `src/app/(app)/layout.tsx` that the dashboard depends on (must be mirrored in `src/app/demo/demo-shell.tsx`), including `PortfolioCommandProvider` from `src/contexts/portfolio-command-context.tsx`
- Changes the seed data format in `data/seed-holdings.json` or `data/seed-cash.json`

## Key Files

- `src/app/demo/page.tsx` — server component that loads static JSON and renders DemoShell
- `src/app/demo/demo-shell.tsx` — client component with all providers, demo banner, and `demoMode` flag
- `src/app/demo/layout.tsx` — SEO metadata
- `src/lib/portfolio-context.tsx` — `demoMode` prop skips all API fetches and makes mutations no-ops
- `src/app/(app)/dashboard-shell.tsx` — passes `demoMode`, `initialQuotes`, `initialExchangeRates` through
- `data/demo-quotes.json` — static quotes for all seed tickers (22 entries)
- `data/demo-exchange-rates.json` — static FX rates

## How demoMode Works

When `demoMode={true}` on `PortfolioProvider`:

- All API fetches are skipped (holdings, cash, quotes, exchange rates, portfolios, alerts)
- State is initialized from `initialHoldings`, `initialCash`, `initialQuotes`, `initialExchangeRates`
- All mutation callbacks (`addHolding`, `removeHolding`, etc.) are no-ops
- Auto-refresh intervals and name enrichment effects are disabled
- `localStorage` reads/writes are skipped

## What to Check

When modifying the dashboard or its data layer:

1. **New provider added to `(app)/layout.tsx`?** — Add it to `demo-shell.tsx` too
2. **New context field consumed by Dashboard?** — Ensure it has a sensible default in demo mode
3. **New data type on holdings/quotes?** — Update `data/demo-quotes.json` or `data/seed-holdings.json` to include the new fields
4. **New effect in PortfolioProvider?** — Gate it with `if (demoMode) return;` if it makes API calls or writes to localStorage
5. **Verify the demo still renders** — visit `/demo` after UI changes to confirm no blank screens or errors
